<title>INDIA: India soybean price falls, oil, meal prices steady.</title>
<headline>India soybean price falls, oil, meal prices steady.</headline>
<dateline>INDORE, India 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soybean prices fell 50-100 rupees per tonne in central India on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>Soyoil prices were steady in thin trading.</p>
<p>Soymeal prices were steady at $281-282 per tonne for export. Rapeseed extraction prices decreased on increased offerings and were quoted at $117 per tonne for ready shipment and $110-111 per tonne for March/April shipment. Rapeseed extraction was 4,000 rupees FOR Bedibunder for ready delivery and 3,850 rupees per tonne for March/April delivery.</p>
<p>Business volume was dull and the undertone was easy.</p>
